:''Not to be confused with [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)]] or [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)]].''
'''Bun Bun Monger Prototype'''  is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] and the gift for all players who participate in the PC version, [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou]]. It is unlockable in the Cat Storage after the player has cleared [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Fukuoka]]. This cat is not available in the mobile version. [[True Form]] gains increased health and damage, as well as the ability to [[Survive|survive]] a lethal strike.

